  "reasoning": "Content Policy Analyst.\nAudio calls in Indian languages (Telugu in this case).\n\"Friends\" app (User pays Expert).\n\n        *   `PlatformMove`: Proposing/asking to move outside the app (WhatsApp, Telegram, phone numbers, meeting in person).\n        *   `SuspiciousActivity`: Money/payment linked to sexual content/services.\n        *   `Explicit-Flirting`: Sexual talk, requests for nudity, sexual acts, \"open talk\".\n        *   `About a Violation`: Warnings, stories, refusals, hypotheticals (violation: \"no\", confidence $\\le 0.3$).\n\n        *   Ordinary conversation (greetings, small talk, family, work, location).\n        *   Internal app call types (video/audio call, \"call me\").\n        *   \"Normal talk\" (non-sexual).\n        *   External apps mentioned for other reasons.\n        *   Compliments, \"I love you\", relationship talk.\n        *   \"Show/open\" for non-body things.\nMinified JSON object following the provided schema.\n\n    *   [00:00] హలో (Hello) -> Greeting. (Allowed)\n    *   [00:10] ఎక్కడ నుంచి ఎక్కడ నుంచి హలో మీరు సంకేత్ లేరా (From where, from where, hello, are you Sanket?) -> Question about identity/location. (Allowed)\n    *   [00:20] ఒక్క నిమిషం నా దగ్గర హలో నా దగ్గర కనిపించలేదు (One minute, hello, it didn't appear with me) -> Technical/Call quality. (Allowed)\n    *   [00:30] మ్యాగీ డబ్బాల మీద (On Maggie boxes) -> Random conversation/Small talk. (Allowed)\n    *   [00:40] ఆ (Ah) -> Filler. (Allowed)\n    *   [00:50] హలో హలో హలో (Hello hello hello) -> Greeting. (Allowed)\n    *   [01:00] మీ వైఫ్ లేరా మరి అంత దిగులుగా మాట్లాడుతున్నారు ఎటు వెళ్ళారు (Is your wife not there? Why are you talking so sadly? Where did she go?) -> Question about family/spouse. (Allowed)\n    *   [01:10] ఊర్లో ఉన్నది జాబ్ చేస్తున్నాం ఏం కనిపించట్లేదు ఆ స్థలమే కనిపిస్తుంది నేను ఇంతకుముందే వచ్చానమ్మా అందుకే కొంచెం కష్టపడి (She is in the village, we are doing a job, nothing is visible, only that place is visible, I came before, mother, that